{
  "info": {
    "name": "TaskFlow Enterprise - Caso Practico 5",
    "description": "Coleccion Postman del Caso Practico 5 (TaskFlow Enterprise). Cubre los CRUD de los 5 integrantes.\n\nDistribucion oficial:\n- Integrante 1 (Jonier): Configuracion inicial + Empleados\n- Integrante 2 (Yhan): Departamentos\n- Integrante 3 (Vanya): Proyectos\n- Integrante 4 (Norman): Tareas\n- Integrante 5 (Jhonatan): Consultas Avanzadas\n\nEl orden de las carpetas sigue la logica del flujo de datos (Departamentos -> Empleados -> Proyectos -> Tareas -> Consultas Avanzadas).\n\nNota: la actualizacion se implementa con el metodo PATCH (los controllers usan @Patch).\n\nVariables para editar antes de usar:\n- baseUrl: URL del servidor (default http://localhost:3000)\n- departmentId / employeeId / proyectoId / taskId: ids de ejemplo; ajustalos con los que devuelva cada POST.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "departmentId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "employeeId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "proyectoId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "taskId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Departamentos (Integrante 2 - Yhan)",
      "description": "Integrante 2 (Yhan): CRUD de Departamentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear Departamento - POST",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Desarrollo\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Area de desarrollo de software\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/departments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["departments"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Departamentos - GET",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/departments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["departments"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener Departamento por id - GET",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["departments", "{{departmentId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Departamento - PATCH",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Desarrollo y Diseno\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Area actualizada de desarrollo y diseno\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["departments", "{{departmentId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar Departamento - DELETE",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["departments", "{{departmentId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
